1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Services that clash on site were never coordinated.
By the time a duct, a tray and a pipe find the same 300 mm of space, the concrete is already poured.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:22,000
MEP BIM modelling, built to an agreed requirement.
Mechanical piping, HVAC, electrical, plumbing and drainage, fire protection and ELV. Accuracy, level of detail and naming agreed before modelling starts.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Coordination and clash resolution: tests, tolerances, then a recorded loop.
Detection, grouping, ownership, proposed change, approved correction, recheck and recorded closure. We do not promise a clash-free model.

4
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:47,000
All MEP shop drawings, from your approved design.
Layouts, sections, risers and schematics with dimensions, levels, tags and schedules. No design changes without the responsible party approving them.

5
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Builders' work and QA/QC.
Composite plans with sleeves and penetrations coordinated from the resolved model. Model, drawing and schedule checked against each other.

6
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
As-built models and handover.
Only authorised changes, recorded and archived, with registers, revision history and the agreed asset data.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:22,000
